,"b":"MAT","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[9,9],"r":[25,34],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Matt. xxv. 21, Matt xxv. 23, Matt. xxv. 34."},{"id":"555dfa333889","b":"ISA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[10,10],"r":[1,22],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"vid. Orat. iii. §35, and Isa. i. 22."},{"id":"b27394156b8d","b":"WIS","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[11,11],"r":[7,25],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"low","cited":"S. Cyril, Dial iv. init. p. 505 E. speaks of the qrulloumeh, and disclaims it, Thesaur. 6. p. 43. Athan. disclaims it, Expos. §1. Orat. i. §21. So does Alexander, ap. Theod. Hist. i 3. p. 743. On the other hand, Athanasius quotes it in a passage which he adduces from Theognostus, infr. §25. and from Dionysius, de Sent. D. §23. and Origen uses it, Periarchon, i. 2. It is derived from Wisd. vii. 25.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, nicht prüfbar)"},{"id":"273705418cf5","b":"MAT","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[11,11],"r":[3,17],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Matt. iii. 17."},{"id":"2d288feb30a5","b":"MAT","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[12,12],"r":[11,27],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Matt. xi. 27."},{"id":"94a78fe80d54","b":"HEB","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[12,12],"r":[1,3],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Heb. i. 3."},{"id":"871241337a89","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[12,12],"r":[36,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. xxxvi. 9.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"18160b296175","b":"BAR","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[12,12],"r":[3,12],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"low","cited":"Bar. iii. 12.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, nicht prüfbar)"},{"id":"595f4b63def3","b":"JER","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[12,12],"r":[2,13],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Jer. ii. 13. Vid. infr. passim. All these titles, `Word, Wisdom, Light' &c., serve to guard the title `Son' from any notions of parts or dimensions, e.g. `He is not composed of parts, but being impassible and single. He is impassibly and indivisibly Father of the Son ...for ...the Word and Wisdom is neither creature, nor part of Him Whose Word He is, nor an offspring passibly begotten.' Orat. i. §28."},{"id":"303c3d55855a","b":"JHN","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[12,12],"r":[14,6],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"John xiv. 6."},{"id":"e95fbd53de6e","b":"PRO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[13,13],"r":[8,22],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Prov. viii. 22, and cf. Orat. ii. throughout"},{"id":"c42b210b9fa5","b":"GEN","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[13,13],"r":[1,1],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Gen. i. 1."},{"id":"b4da58cff676","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":3,"p":[13,13],"r":[110,3],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c"