hanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[44,6],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"All the titles of the Son of God are consistent with each other, and variously represent one and the same Person. `Son' and `Word,' denote His derivation; `Word' and `Image,' His Similitude; `Word' and `Wisdom,' His immateriality; `Wisdom' and `Hand,' His coexistence. `If He is not Son, neither is He Image' Orat. ii. §2. 'How is them Word and Wisdom, unless He be a proper offspring of His substance? ii. §22. Vid. also Orat. i. §20. 21. and at great length Orat. iv. §20, &c. vid. also Naz. Orat. 30. n. 20. Basil. contr. Eunom. i. 18. Hilar. de Trin. vii. 11. August. in Joan. xlviii. 6. and in Psalm. xliv. 5 . Psalm (xlv.) 5.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"927d155622f1","b":"ISA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[48,13],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Is. xlviii. 13."},{"id":"1ba04542b90d","b":"ISA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[51,16],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Is li. 16."},{"id":"0c25d22cd253","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[104,24],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. civ. 24."},{"id":"9bb0aab0f0ae","b":"PRO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[3,19],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Prov. iii. 19."},{"id":"d163f164c0bf","b":"JHN","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[1,1,1,3],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"John i. 1-3."},{"id":"08d8510548e6","b":"HEB","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[1,1],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Heb. i. 1, Heb. i. 2."},{"id":"2376b0c7f998","b":"HEB","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[1,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Heb. i. 1, Heb. i. 2."},{"id":"8103dcae5546","b":"1CO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[8,6],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"1 Cor. viii. 6."},{"id":"95712403df1a","b":"COL","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[1,12,1,17],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Col. i. 12-17."},{"id":"f24f997cc9bc","b":"HEB","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[1,1],"r":[11,3],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Heb. xi. 3."},{"id":"bc89aff37a6c","b":"HEB","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[1,1],"r":[1,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"By aiwn , age, seems to be meant duration, or the measure of duration, before or independent of the existence of motion, which is in measure of time. As motion, and therefore time, are creatures, so are the ages. Considered as the measure of duration, an age has a sort of positive existence, though not an ousia or substance, and means the same as `world,' or an existing system of things viewed apart from time and motion. Vid. Theod. in Hebr. i. 2. Our Lord then is the Maker of the ages thus considered, as the Apostle also tells us, Hebr. xi. 3. and God is the King of the ages, Tim. 1. 17. or is before all ages, as being eternal, or proaiwnioj ideai aiwnotoke aiwnioj aiwnioj"},{"id":"a46a6ed85e6e","b":"1CO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[3,3],"r":[8,6],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"1 Cor. viii. 6."},{"id":"c8d9e25df3c9","b":"2CO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[3,3],"r":[5,17],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Cor. v. 17."},{"id":"20d532279092","b":"1CO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[4,4],"r":[11,7],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"1 Cor. xi. 7."},{"id":"a67aa4fcb532","b":"2CO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[4,4],"r":[4,11],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Cor. iv. 11."},{"id":"82918b167288","b":"ACT","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[4,4],"r":[17,28],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Acts xvii. 28."},{"id":"4455064cd1c4","b":"ROM","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[4,4],"r":[8,35],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Rom viii. 35, who shall separate."},{"id":"14fdf44f0359","b":"JOL","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[4,4],"r":[2,25],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Joel ii. 25."},{"id":"b8eedb301524","b":"EXO","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":5,"p":[4,4],"r":[12,41],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Ex. xii. 41."},{"id":"36ddc8a31183","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.athanasius.de_decretis","w":"athanasius.de_decretis","a":"athanasi